(rw,relatime,vers=3,rsize=1024,wsize=1024,namlen=255,hard,nolock,proto=udp,timeo=11,retrans=3,sec=sys,mountaddr=10.0.0.2,mountvers=3,mountport=644,mountproto=udp,local_lock=all,addr=10.0.0.2)


Any suggestions?

